<script setup lang="ts">import { computed } from 'vue';import { useAppStore } from '@/stores/app';import { financeMetrics,money,categoryTotals } from '@/domain/finance';import { boardProgress } from '@/domain/tasks';import StatCard from '@/components/StatCard.vue';import UiIcon from '@/components/UiIcon.vue';const store=useAppStore();const metrics=computed(()=>financeMetrics(store.data.finance));const categories=computed(()=>categoryTotals(store.data.finance.transactions).slice(0,4));const board=computed(()=>store.activeBoard);const greeting=()=>new Date().getHours()<12?'Dzień dobry':new Date().getHours()<18?'Dzień dobry':'Dobry wieczór'</script>
<template><section><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="kicker">{{new Date().toLocaleDateString('pl-PL',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long'})}}</p><h1>{{greeting()}}, Mateusz</h1><p>Wszystko, co ważne, w jednym bezpiecznym miejscu.</p></div><RouterLink class="button primary" to="/finance"><UiIcon name="Plus"/> Nowa transakcja</RouterLink></div><div class="stats-grid"><StatCard label="Saldo" :value="money(metrics.balance)" hint="Łączny przepływ" icon="Landmark" tone="blue"/><StatCard label="Oszczędności" :value="`${metrics.savingsRate.toFixed(1)}%`" hint="Wskaźnik oszczędzania" icon="PiggyBank" tone="green"/><StatCard label="Budżet" :value="`${metrics.budgetUsed.toFixed(0)}%`" hint="Wykorzystanie planu" icon="Gauge" tone="amber"/><StatCard label="Kondycja" :value="`${metrics.health}/100`" hint="Financial Health Score" icon="HeartPulse" tone="violet"/></div><div class="dashboard-grid"><article class="card span-2"><header class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">FINANSE</p><h2>Struktura wydatków</h2></div><RouterLink to="/finance">Zobacz wszystko <UiIcon name="ArrowRight" :size="16"/></RouterLink></header><div v-if="categories.length" class="category-list"><div v-for="([name,value],index) in categories" :key="name"><div><span>{{name}}</span><b>{{money(value)}}</b></div><progress :value="value" :max="categories[0][1]" :aria-label="`${name}: ${money(value)}`" :class="`bar-${index}`"/></div></div><p v-else class="empty">Brak danych o wydatkach.</p></article><article class="card"><header class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ZADANIA</p><h2>{{board?.name??'Projekt'}}</h2></div><RouterLink to="/tasks" aria-label="Przejdź do zadań"><UiIcon name="ArrowUpRight"/></RouterLink></header><div class="project-progress"><span>{{board?boardProgress(board):0}}%</span><div><b>Postęp projektu</b><p class="muted">{{board?.columns.flatMap(c=>c.cards).length??0}} kart łącznie</p></div></div><progress :value="board?boardProgress(board):0" max="100" aria-label="Postęp projektu"/><div class="mini-columns"><div v-for="column in board?.columns" :key="column.id"><span>{{column.cards.length}}</span><small>{{column.name}}</small></div></div></article><article class="card"><header class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEJF</p><h2>Bezpieczeństwo</h2></div><span class="status"><i/> Chroniony</span></header><div class="vault-hero"><span class="icon-box green"><UiIcon name="ShieldCheck" :size="28"/></span><div><strong>Szyfrowanie AES-256</strong><p class="muted">Twój sejf jest przechowywany lokalnie i zaszyfrowany.</p></div></div><RouterLink class="button secondary full" to="/vault">Otwórz sejf <UiIcon name="ArrowRight"/></RouterLink></article></div></section></template>
